// Front 124 — bpp CLI · examples/scaffold/app/not-found.bpp
//
// Demonstrates: step 5 — the root not-found boundary of the scaffold. The
// file's name is its kind: for `not-found.bpp`, jhonstart's `bpp` function
// (front 116) emits `pub fn NotFound() -> Element` — the name onze's generated routes table
// imports from a not-found module (`onze-cli/src/generate.bp`). It takes no
// parameter, so the fence has no `route`.
//
// A fence may be empty of statements: the imports are declarations, and the
// body of `NotFound` is the template alone.
//
// Upstream: astro-docs/07-astro-pages.md (Página de Erro 404 Personalizada)
//           https://docs.astro.build/en/basics/astro-pages/#custom-404-error-page

